{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05这类短停留段的小字感受词仍然偏密，实际扫读不如X利落，容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把心理转折和关键动机加亮，观众即使不逐字阅读，也更容易抓住每段发生了什么、人物为什么这样反应；船、水、摇荡、回声等反复出现的意象又把各段串成一条连续的情绪线。尤其是随音乐段落出现的感受词，让情绪变化有了具体的声音和身体质感，细腻程度明显胜过X。虽然X更容易快速扫读，但综合理解、情绪连贯性和音乐对应的丰富程度，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b98b75d6-bb70-4442-8a01-2c15c94c7c4c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163756815392Z", "elapsed_seconds": 205.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:41:22.251423+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "10df22258f008f0002955be3c4d9e08ef6fcc859fa234f610d1c50b90ea6d0c1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa